# Visual Studio Temporary Files and Build Artifacts

## Project Build Outputs
# Object files
*.obj
# Executables and Libraries
*.exe
*.dll
*.lib
*.exp
# Program Database files (for debugging)
*.pdb
*.ilk
# Other build-related files
*.tlog
*.log
*.aps
*.bsc
*.map
*.sbr
*.res
*.ipch
*.pch # Precompiled headers

## Visual Studio Solution/Project User Files
*.suo
*.user
*.userosscache
*.opendb
*.opensdf
*.sdf
*.vc.db
*.vshost.* # Visual Studio hosting process files
*.ide # Visual Studio IDE files (e.g., .intellisense)

## Visual Studio Generated Folders
# Solution user-specific settings
.vs/
# Default build output directories
Debug/
Release/
x64/Debug/
x64/Release/
# Intermediate project files
ipch/

## Other Common Ignores
# Backup files
*~
# MacOS specific files
.DS_Store

